---
---
<section class="section bg-white">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="feature-split">
      <div class="feat-text">
        <span class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--accent-text)">Live Class</span>
        <span class="script script-lg" style="color:var(--accent-text)">Nobody Slips Through</span>
        <h2 class="headline">Every student is seen. Nothing is missed.</h2>
        <p class="subhead">Live Class tracks how every student's session is going in real time: levels, session timers, teacher notes, in-class flags, and checklist items. No student is invisible and nothing gets missed. That daily attention to each child is what keeps families enrolled.</p>
        <div class="feat-points">
          <div class="feat-point">
            <div class="feat-point-icon solid solid-orange">
              <svg aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div><strong style="color:var(--text)">Per-student session tracking</strong><br>Levels, timers, and progress for every child, live on one screen</div>
          </div>
          <div class="feat-point">
            <div class="feat-point-icon solid solid-orange">
              <svg aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 15s1-1 4-1 5 2 8 2 4-1 4-1V3s-1 1-4 1-5-2-8-2-4 1-4 1z"/><line x1="4" x2="4" y1="22" y2="15"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div><strong style="color:var(--text)">Teacher notes and flags</strong><br>Anything needing attention is captured in the moment</div>
          </div>
          <div class="feat-point">
            <div class="feat-point-icon solid solid-orange">
              <svg aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 11 12 14 22 4"/><path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div><strong style="color:var(--text)">In-class checklists</strong><br>Recurring items so nothing gets skipped, student by student</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-demo" data-cta="See It Live">See It Live</a>
      </div>
      <div class="feat-visual">
        <div class="blob" aria-hidden="true" style="background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(224,113,44,.15),transparent 68%);width:120%;height:120%;top:-10%;left:-10%"></div>
        <div class="shot-bezel"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="2340" height="1659" src="/images/live-class-session.webp" alt="Live Class per-student session view"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
